# Files EAS shouldn't upload as part of the build context.
# EAS falls back to .gitignore if this file is absent, but being
# explicit here means build uploads stay small and fast even if
# .gitignore ever changes for unrelated reasons.
#
# Deliberately not excluding android/ or ios/ — this project is pure
# managed workflow (no native folders checked in); if that ever
# changes (e.g. someone runs `expo prebuild` locally), those folders
# would actually be needed by the build, not safe to blanket-ignore.

node_modules/
.expo/
.git/
*.log
.DS_Store
